			"notes": "## Changes since v1.1.0\n\n- Allowed to export and import land registry databases. (`78274be`)\n- Allowed to create parcel groups and allow to manage parcels as groups. (`7a2a071`)\n- Allowed to toggle auto-color that will pick a color that's most different than the color of the parcels that touch that parcel. Making sure it automatically updates when it's toggled on as the parcel touches less or more chunks, so the color is kept unique. (`289b397`)\n- Displayed the parcel name in the largest region instead of displaying per chunk. (`0df2ec8`)\n- Allowed to select multiple chunks by toggling it by a button in the map GUI, to allow manage multiple chunks at the same time. (`7826d5d`)"
		},
