			"notes": "## Changes since v1.0.4\n\n- Optionally allowed to pass RGBA instead of RGB as the color, if an RGBA color is passed as the parcel color, it will overwrite the default transparency. Will now assign a random unique color tonew parcels, making sure it's different as possible from the other parcels' colors. (`ba0ee5e`)\n- Allowed to reset color, use, description, owner, etc with commands. Added an option for each command in the map menu. Added a search bar for map menu options that take a parcel name as a selec ion. (`b2c3cf5`)"
